WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.232 --> 00:00:15.496
"Why did you eat all that food?"

2
00:00:15.936 --> 00:00:16.636
Roxy asked.

3
00:00:17.796 --> 00:00:21.577
Bajie was sitting in a jail cell while Roxy and Detective Smith asked questions.

4
00:00:21.597 --> 00:00:24.398
"I was hungry."

5
00:00:25.138 --> 00:00:26.559
Bajie shrugged and looked around.

6
00:00:26.579 --> 00:00:28.759
"Where am I anyway?"

7
00:00:29.919 --> 00:00:31.380
Detective Smith folded his arms.

8
00:00:32.388 --> 00:00:33.489
"In jail."

9
00:00:33.509 --> 00:00:35.970
Bajie chuckled.

10
00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:39.732
"Oh, I know this is a jail.

11
00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:42.514
I've been in jail plenty of times.

12
00:00:43.895 --> 00:00:46.996
In fact, I could easily break out of here if I wanted to.

13
00:00:48.117 --> 00:00:50.578
But I promised the bodhisattva that I'd be good.

14
00:00:52.299 --> 00:00:54.781
It definitely isn't good to break out of jail."

15
00:00:56.422 --> 00:00:57.843
Roxy looked at Detective Smith.

16
00:00:57.863 --> 00:01:00.164
"Who's the bodhisattva?"

17
00:01:01.204 --> 00:01:03.386
The detective was writing everything in his notebook.

18
00:01:04.267 --> 00:01:05.268
"I have no idea."

19
00:01:05.288 --> 00:01:10.492
"I'm wondering what kingdom I'm in," Bajie went on.

20
00:01:10.512 --> 00:01:16.077
"This place doesn't look like any other kingdom I've seen—the buildings are so tall."

21
00:01:17.558 --> 00:01:20.340
"Metro City isn't a kingdom," Roxy said.

22
00:01:20.360 --> 00:01:22.902
"I guess you've never been here before?"

23
00:01:24.263 --> 00:01:25.384
Bajie shook his head.

24
00:01:25.404 --> 00:01:29.448
"I've been traveling to the West with some friends for a long time.

25
00:01:30.284 --> 00:01:32.405
But this morning some demons kidnapped us."

26
00:01:33.845 --> 00:01:35.445
Detective Smith raised an eyebrow.

27
00:01:35.465 --> 00:01:37.946
"You were kidnapped by demons?"

28
00:01:37.966 --> 00:01:41.107
"It happens all the time."

29
00:01:41.747 --> 00:01:42.527
Bajie shrugged.

30
00:01:42.547 --> 00:01:45.108
"It's usually not a big deal.

31
00:01:48.029 --> 00:01:52.290
I attacked them and fought very bravely, so they were definitely afraid of me.

32
00:01:53.891 --> 00:01:55.071
But somebody tripped me.

33
00:01:57.712 --> 00:02:00.317
Then all of a sudden, I was here in this kingdom!"

34
00:02:05.920 --> 00:02:08.802
Wukong looked around the mountain where he'd left his companions.

35
00:02:12.824 --> 00:02:14.545
village was an illusion," he thought.

36
00:02:14.565 --> 00:02:19.748
"When the Demon of Black Rain made the rainstorm, Master probably entered a house."

37
00:02:21.229 --> 00:02:24.050
Wukong understood why the Tang Monk had fallen for the trick.

38
00:02:24.831 --> 00:02:27.092
But Wujing and Bajie should have known better.

39
00:02:29.172 --> 00:02:30.013
Wukong sighed.

40
00:02:30.533 --> 00:02:34.496
"There must be a cave nearby since demons usually live in caves."

41
00:02:36.138 --> 00:02:38.299
Wukong searched all over the mountain's slopes.

42
00:02:41.142 --> 00:02:43.364
Finally he found a door in the side of the mountain.

43
00:02:48.608 --> 00:02:51.190
He pounded on the door and shouted, "Demons!

44
00:02:51.610 --> 00:02:53.672
Release my master right now or else!"

45
00:02:56.128 --> 00:02:59.109
Wukong shook his fist and yelled all sorts of terrible things.

46
00:03:05.372 --> 00:03:09.133
Finally the door flew open, and the Demon of Black Rain stomped outside.

47
00:03:09.153 --> 00:03:12.575
"You're rude!"

48
00:03:12.595 --> 00:03:15.456
"I'm powerful too!"

49
00:03:18.457 --> 00:03:20.078
Wukong swung his iron bar.

50
00:03:20.638 --> 00:03:25.020
Poof! The demon disappeared, and in his place was a puddle of rainwater.

51
00:03:27.668 --> 00:03:28.569
"Ha!" Wukong smiled.

52
00:03:28.589 --> 00:03:31.030
"I destroyed him with one strike!"

53
00:03:32.251 --> 00:03:34.472
He ran into the cave, swinging his iron bar.

54
00:03:34.492 --> 00:03:41.396
"Ahh!" All the small demons screamed and ran out of the cave.

55
00:03:43.497 --> 00:03:46.219
Wukong found the Tang Monk and Wujing, and untied them.

56
00:03:50.761 --> 00:03:51.402
you, Wukong!"

57
00:03:51.682 --> 00:03:52.562
the Tang Monk said.

58
00:03:52.582 --> 00:03:55.104
"You're welcome, Master."

59
00:03:56.396 --> 00:03:57.456
Wukong looked around.

60
00:03:57.476 --> 00:03:59.017
"Where's Bajie?"

61
00:04:00.137 --> 00:04:01.657
Wujing seemed surprised.

62
00:04:02.338 --> 00:04:03.238
"You didn't see him?

63
00:04:03.518 --> 00:04:05.499
He broke free and went to fight the demons."

64
00:04:05.519 --> 00:04:09.079
"He's not in the cave," Wukong said.

65
00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:11.880
The Tang Monk shook his head.

66
00:04:11.900 --> 00:04:16.642
"He kept complaining about being hungry, so he probably went to find food."

67
00:04:18.322 --> 00:04:19.222
Wujing frowned.

68
00:04:19.242 --> 00:04:21.623
"And he left us tied up.

69
00:04:22.183 --> 00:04:23.023
How terrible!"

70
00:04:24.224 --> 00:04:25.324
Wukong shook his head.

71
00:04:26.156 --> 00:04:28.217
"Bajie is awful sometimes."

72
00:04:29.738 --> 00:04:34.280
Just then Wukong heard footsteps and realized a bird demon was trying to sneak by.

73
00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:37.321
Wukong quickly jumped in front of her.

74
00:04:38.462 --> 00:04:39.702
The bird demon stepped back.

75
00:04:39.722 --> 00:04:41.683
"Please don't hurt me!

76
00:04:41.703 --> 00:04:43.564
I know where your friend is!"
